│ 300-399            │       3.29 │
│ 400-499            │       3.32 │
│ 500-599            │       3.12 │
│ 600-699            │       3.65 │
╰────────────────────┴────────────╯


From the results we can say very short descriptions (0-99 characters) are related 
with substantially lower ratings which is 1.87. From 100-499 characters, the average 
rating gradually increases from 3.21 to 3.32. Then the 'avg-rating' drops noticeably
to 3.12 where the description length is between 500 and 599. Eventually, products
with description length range between 600 and 699 have the highest average rating, 3.65. 
From this we can make a general conclusion: there appears to be a positive relationship
between description length and average product rating. However, the relationship 
is not consistently increasing. */



